OL,3,AInterest rates hiked to 4% in first
OL,4,Aincrease in over three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe higher level will increase the cost
OL,7,Fof borrowing for things such as
OL,8,Fmortgages, loans and credit cards, but
OL,9,Fwill also lead to higher returns on
OL,10,Fsavings.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
